<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\惑星宝石箱.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\夜桜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Ooh! They've finally started blooming for real!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Seeing the cherry blossoms on the goshinboku really makes it feel like spring, huh!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Looking at the cherry blossoms at night like this makes me want to spread out a fancy boxed lunch!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">, I just treated you at Zahha a little while ago!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, look! A frankfurter stall!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Listen when people talk to you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夜桜にぎわい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Here, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>! This one's my treat! Frankfurters, they're delicious!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? O-okay... thanks... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="1"> treating me feels kind of creepy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Also, could you take these three to <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> as a present from me?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's with </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">... Why are you suddenly treating people...?"</STYLE><PG>
"Well, you'll be looking after me at the Arata settlement soon, so it's just a small token of my feelings."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Your thanks for us looking after you is a frankfurter, huh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">W-well, with this kind of thing it's the thought that counts, yeah."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But I wonder if </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and her family are home... Seems they're out shopping as a family right now, so these'll get cold."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Stall frankfurters like these are just reheated anyway, so they'll still taste good later out of the microwave."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, sure, but..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\夜桜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey, hey, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, are there lots of cherry trees at the Arata settlement too?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There are next to none. This year too, it'll probably just be the one cherry tree at the Niimura main family's house in bloom."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's kind of lonely... 
{PAUSE ""}
Oh, then I want to do fireworks!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Fireworks, this time of year?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If there aren't many cherry blossoms, then fireworks at least!
{PAUSE ""}
　A night sky where the sights of different seasons meet! Don't you think that's wonderful!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, I'm sure it'd be pretty, but </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">'re totally in vacation mode..."</STYLE><PG>
"N-no, no! I'm going to the Arata settlement following <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s revelation, after all!
{PAUSE ""}
　I'm serious, perfectly serious!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, yeah, sure... Well, suit yourself."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah! They're selling Super Soda Bomber over there!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whaaat!? Let's go, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I hate that stuff, though..."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
